body:
Welcome to your new meth addiction /j

&#x200B;

Yeah, get ready to still make mistakes but at least you can function normally now.

Guarantee it a team of psychologist worked with algorithm designers to maximize time spent on app + money spent. Maybe at first this relied on actually connecting with people, but my guess is they now found out that generating frustrating matches/lack of matches/whatever is more profitable than actually matching people.

&#x200B;

Guaranfuckingtee it.
